    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43614" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sēmustus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sēmĭ-ustus</span></b> ), a,
		um, adj.
		uro, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>half-burned</i> (not ante-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: Enceladi semustum fulmine corpus.
				<i><span class="en">Verg.
				A. 3, 578</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">robora,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 5, 697</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">facem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. F.
					4, 167</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Sil. 3, 16</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Stat.
				Th. 12, 439 al.</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">forum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					26, 27</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">simulacra,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					31, 30</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Vell. 2, 119, 6</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tectorum vestigia lacera et semusta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac.
					A. 15, 40</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Suet. Dom. 15
			al.</span></i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">se populare incendium priore consulatu semustum
					effugisse,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					22, 40, 3</span></i>
			.</div>
